  "name": "Endemic Surge",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/holy/barrier-shield-winged-cross.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Also at 2nd level, you can cause your pathogens to replicate exponentially. As an action, you can expend a use of your Experimental Medicine feature to cause your pathogens to surge, rather than transform. While this feature is active, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain 5 temporary hit points for each level you have in this class.</li>\n<li>You gain resistance to necrotic and poison damage.</li>\n<li>When you deal your Infection Radius damage, roll the damage die a second time and add it to the total.</li>\n<li>Your attacks and creations deal an extra 1d6 necrotic damage to any target they damage.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This transformation follows the same rules as your standard Experimental Medicine transformations.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
